/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":937524,"digest":"sha256:39bc2a16b41b54377c55462a0f3d104fb8d91e30f211d612b8dcd16b71960f8d","download_count":3,"created_at":"2026-11-17T19:51:39Z","updated_at":"2026-11-17T19:51:40Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/polyspec/template/releases/download/v0.0.31/polyspec_template-0.0.31-cp314-abi3-manylinux_2_34_x86_64.whl"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/polyspec/template/tarball/v0.0.31","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/polyspec/template/zipball/v0.0.31","body":"- The release carries the stub `polyspec_template.stub.php` that binding generates beside the sources of the Composer package `polyspec/template` (T28.141): `config/release.json` declares the output of `make bindings` as `generated` of `packages/php-ext`, which the kit packs into the archive, so a static analysis of a consumer reads the classes of the extension from it.\n\n- `make consumer-phpstan-check VERSION=X.Y.Z` checks that PHPStan of a consumer reads the classes of the PHP extension from the stub of the release archive (T28.141): the probe fails without the stub and passes with it, with the stub declared through `scanFiles`, which PHPStan 2.3 reads where `stubFiles` does not. The job php-ext runs it on the candidate archives of the first section of this file (`consumer-phpstan-ci`), so a release without the stub fails in CI.\n\n- The job `ci-php-ext` installs uv, which the consumer check `consumer-phpstan-ci` needs: `release-candidate-assets` links the Python project of the repository with uv (T28.141).\n"}